-Sessions never expire.
+Sessions expire `SESSION_TTL` (3600 seconds) after they are saved. Restoring
+a session older than the TTL raises `SessionExpiredError`. Each restore also
+purges expired entries from the on-disk cache; call `purge_expired()`
+directly to clean up the cache without restoring a session.
